ob filename text source be input ya

from filename "../../module/read_html_markdown.pya" ob name read to name read be import do
from filename "../../module/chip_refinery.pya" ob name chip to name chip be import do

ob name run root to name text workspace root be text do
ob name run id to name text run id be text do
ob filename of ob of source to name text source url be text do

ob text "printf '%s' " to name text stem cmd be text do
ob name text source url to name stem cmd be plus do
ob text " | sed 's#^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9+.-]*://##' | tr '/:?&=#[]()% ' '_' | tr -s '_' | sed 's/^_//' | sed 's/_$//' | cut -c1-96 | tr -d '\\n'" to name stem cmd be plus do
su name stem stage ob name text stem cmd be command do

ob name workspace root to name text run artifacts dir path be plus do
ob text "/artifacts/" to name run artifacts dir path be plus do
ob name run id to name run artifacts dir path be plus do

ob name run artifacts dir path to name text stage dir path be plus do
ob text "/chip-stage-1" to name stage dir path be plus do

ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text stage mkdir cmd be text do
ob name stage dir path to name stage mkdir cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name stage mkdir cmd be plus do
su name stage mkdir ob name text stage mkdir cmd be command do

ob name stage dir path to name text html path be plus do
ob text "/" to name html path be plus do
ob name stem stage to name html path be plus do
ob text ".html" to name html path be plus do

ob name stage dir path to name text markdown path be plus do
ob text "/" to name markdown path be plus do
ob name stem stage to name markdown path be plus do
ob text ".md" to name markdown path be plus do
ob name markdown path to name filename markdown filename be filename do

ob name stage dir path to name text session markdown path be plus do
ob text "/" to name session markdown path be plus do
ob name stem stage to name session markdown path be plus do
ob text "_session.md" to name session markdown path be plus do
ob name session markdown path to name filename session markdown filename be filename do

ob name stage dir path to name text local wise path be plus do
ob text "/" to name local wise path be plus do
ob name stem stage to name local wise path be plus do
ob text "_wise_chips.series.pya" to name local wise path be plus do
ob name local wise path to name filename local wise filename be filename do

ob name run artifacts dir path to name text final wise path be plus do
ob text "/" to name final wise path be plus do
ob name stem stage to name final wise path be plus do
ob text "_wise_chips.series.pya" to name final wise path be plus do
ob name final wise path to name filename final wise filename be filename do

su name download stage from filename of ob of source as wo web fromstate name https to filename of ob of html path be download do
from filename of ob of html path fromstate wo html become wo markdown to name text markdown source be read do
su name markdown write stage ob name markdown source to filename of ob of markdown filename be write do

ob text "node -e \"const fs=require('fs'); const source=fs.readFileSync(process.argv[1],'utf8'); const match=source.match(/^# [A-Za-z]+ [0-9]{1,2}, [0-9]{4}[\\s\\S]*$/m); if(!match){process.exit(2);} fs.writeFileSync(process.argv[2], match[0]);\" \"" to name text session trim cmd be text do
ob name markdown path to name session trim cmd be plus do
ob text "\" \"" to name session trim cmd be plus do
ob name session markdown path to name session trim cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name session trim cmd be plus do
su name session trim stage ob text of session trim cmd be command do
from filename of ob of session markdown filename become wo text to name text session markdown source be read do

exists su name chip style prompt ob text quoted.text.Create wise chips where each chip contains one full question and its full corresponding answer from this channeling session. Preserve complete question and answer units. Do not split a question away from its answer. Prefer chip boundaries at the beginning of each new question..text.quoted be text ya

from name text session markdown source ob name text chip style prompt to name text confederation wise chips be chip do
su name local wise write stage ob name confederation wise chips to filename of ob of local wise filename be write do
su name final wise copy stage ob filename of ob of local wise filename to filename of ob of final wise filename be copy do

ob name workspace root to name text produce dir path be plus do
ob text "/know/produce" to name produce dir path be plus do
ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text produce mkdir cmd be text do
ob name produce dir path to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
su name produce mkdir stage ob name text produce mkdir cmd be command do

ob name produce dir path to name text produce wise path be plus do
ob text "/" to name produce wise path be plus do
ob name stem stage to name produce wise path be plus do
ob text "_wise_chips.series.pya" to name produce wise path be plus do
ob name produce wise path to name filename produce wise filename be filename do

su name produce wise copy stage ob filename of ob of final wise filename to filename of ob of produce wise filename be copy do
su name output stage ob name final wise path be write do
